; Boot sequence: build the local data-product catalog and start
; transmitting it to the ground, automatically on deployment startup.
; DpCatalog does not do this on its own - without these two commands,
; data products accumulate on local disk (DpWriter) forever and never
; get handed to FileDownlink for downlink to the ground.
R00:00:00 DataProducts.dpCat.BUILD_CATALOG
R00:00:01 DataProducts.dpCat.START_XMIT_CATALOG NO_WAIT True
